    "description": "<p>This spell will only affect a magic-user, elf, or a monster which can cast magical spells; it does not affect those which cast only cleric or druid spells. It will make the victim helpless, unable to cast spells or think clearly (as if the victim has an Intelligence score of 2). The victim may make a saving throw vs. spells to avoid the effect, but with a -4 penalty to the roll.</p><p>The <em>feeblemind</em> lasts until removed by a <em>dispel magic</em> spell (at normal chances for success) or by a cleric's <em>cureall</em> spell.</p>",
